# m6_pickup: crates and their grants. m2_play's sweep (A at 30, still fire 60..239, then
# up 40 / hold 20 / down 40 / hold 20) to 2700, plus one long hold-B at 855..934 that
# rewinds across a collection. The drop sequence is [W, cores, W, fork, X, retry, W, fork]
# (W = current weapon kind, X = the next one); debug_weapon = kind * 10 + level, F 0, A 1.
# Re-pinned for M7: endless probe mode from 31 (a normal game dies on this sweep in stage 1;
# a probe hit costs a level and a fork at once). Re-pinned for the catch-up clock (waves.zig:
# the stage clock runs 4 ticks a tick while fewer than 3 enemies are on the field, so the
# waves come sooner): the hold moved from 903 to 783 (the beetle's crate dropped at 631 and
# was collected at 780; until the catch-up 751 and 900). Re-pinned for the mode paces
# (NORMAL: the table clock hurries, 3 ticks a tick, only on an empty field): the waves come
# later again, the crate drops at 685 and is collected at 852, so the hold moved from 783 to
# 855 to cross the grab again (at 783 it fell before the grab). The drop is now 167 ticks
# before the grab, more than the hold's 160, so the hold no longer undoes the drop as well.
# - 685 (game tick 655): a beetle shot down drops crate 1, an F (every beetle killed by a
#   bolt drops; drops 0 -> 1, pickups 1, +50 for the beetle); it drifts left with the bob.
# - 852 (tick 822): the sweep runs into it: F1 -> F2 (weapon 1 -> 2), score 231 -> 331.
# - B 855..934 (80 frames = 160 ticks, 2 fuel per frame): 855 is the first held frame and
#   back at tick 822, still F2; 856 (tick 820) is before the grab: F1 again, score 231, the
#   crate back on screen (pickups 1). 934: tick 664 (the crate still out, drops 1), fuel 20.
#   935: PLAYING, no tick. 80 frames + 160 ticks = 240 updates = two periods of the sweep, so
#   the ship replays (one tick off) the same path and grabs the crate again at 1092 (tick
#   821): F2, score 331.
# - 1110: a probe hit takes the level back (F1).
# - 1417 (tick 1146): the last gnat of a string, a formation, is shot down: crate 2, CORE
#   HOURS, and +200 on top of the gnat's 10 (score 587 -> 797). Fuel is 20 + the refill (1
#   per 10 live ticks) and grazes = 104 at 1631; the grab at 1632 (tick 1361) pays 60: cores
#   0 -> 1, fuel 104 -> 164. (Without the hold the bar is full there and the grant is lost.)
# - 2133: fork 1 (crate 4); 2418: crate 5, the A, turns F1 into A1 (weapon 1 -> 11): kind
#   changes, level kept. Crate 6 drops by 2700 (drops 6).
# debug_history_check is 0 with the crate in flight, during the hold and after it.
--frames 2700 --call-at "31 debug_probe" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_weapon,debug_forks,debug_cores,debug_drops,debug_score,debug_fuel --at "684 debug_drops == 0" --at "685 debug_drops == 1" --at "685 debug_score == 230" --at "694 debug_pickups == 1" --at "694 debug_history_check == 0" --at "851 debug_weapon == 1" --at "852 debug_weapon == 2" --at "852 debug_pickups == 0" --at "852 debug_score == 331" --at "855 debug_state == 5" --at "855 debug_weapon == 2" --at "856 debug_weapon == 1" --at "856 debug_pickups == 1" --at "856 debug_score == 231" --at "856 debug_history_check == 0" --at "900 debug_history_check == 0" --at "934 debug_state == 5" --at "934 debug_game_tick == 664" --at "934 debug_fuel == 20" --at "934 debug_drops == 1" --at "934 debug_history_check == 0" --at "935 debug_state == 1" --at "935 debug_weapon == 1" --at "936 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1091 debug_weapon == 1" --at "1092 debug_weapon == 2" --at "1092 debug_score == 331" --at "1109 debug_weapon == 2" --at "1110 debug_weapon == 1" --at "1416 debug_drops == 1" --at "1417 debug_drops == 2" --at "1417 debug_score == 797" --at "1631 debug_cores == 0" --at "1631 debug_fuel == 104" --at "1632 debug_cores == 1" --at "1632 debug_fuel == 164" --at "2132 debug_forks == 0" --at "2133 debug_forks == 1" --at "2417 debug_weapon == 1" --at "2418 debug_weapon == 11" --at "2699 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_weapon == 11" --expect "debug_cores == 1" --expect "debug_drops == 6"
